cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "H&N TNM Staging Trainer (AJCC)"
message: "Educational use only. Not for clinical practice. Cite the underlying AJCC protocols and publications listed in REVIEW.md, not this tool."
type: software
abstract: >-
  A static, mobile-first web app for learning AJCC head and neck cancer staging.
  Covers all 11 AJCC head and neck chapters plus thyroid, distinguishing the
  three chapters now on Version 9 from those still on the 8th edition. Every
  staging rule carries both an AJCC citation and a peer-reviewed publication.
license: MIT
